      "id": "at-glance",
      "title": "At a glance",
      "body": "Written text often rescues numbers, names, room numbers, and addresses faster than more speech. Use this when you need the other person to give you something you can read, save, or show again.",
      "presentation": "plain-text"
    },
    {
      "id": "breakdown",
      "title": "Break it down",
      "body": "Listen to each piece, then the whole phrase, so the rhythm feels connected instead of memorized word by word.",
