    {
      "id": "why-it-matters",
      "title": "Why it matters",
      "body": "These phrases keep the interaction cooperative when repeating the same words is not helping. For \"Please write it down\", Viết xuống giúp tôi makes the next step easier to answer. Pause after the phrase so the person can confirm before you add more words.",
      "presentation": "plain-text"
    },
    {
      "id": "traveler-insight",
      "title": "Traveler insight",
      "body": "In When You Don't Understand, the reply often comes as a confirmation, a handoff, a price, or a follow-up question. Say Viết xuống giúp tôi once, pause, and watch for the reply. If speech still does not land, move to writing, pointing, or showing the exact word on your phone.",
      "phrases": [
        {
